      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see the vision of eliminating the shim driver. I make another change (CL:8160864) that\n\n1. defines the passthru rules in `cros-ec,i2c-passthru` node.\n2. Use allow-type to indicate the type of passthru.\n3. Remove the capability to use a custom function.\n\nThe change still use the shim driver but I think it\u0027s a good first step.\n\nIs there any example to follow to add a driver that follows the Zephyr device model?",
